WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.298
-Kennosuke!
-Not so fast!

00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:36.911
Over there!

00:00:51.843 --> 00:00:53.511
Miss Sophie, now!

00:01:07.609 --> 00:01:11.988
Masterfully done. I have confirmed
the enemy unit has been neutralized.

00:01:34.052 --> 00:01:35.720
-Out of ammo.
-I know!

00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:41.059
Thank God for the old man Akagi!

00:01:42.977 --> 00:01:44.646
Burn in hell, you bastard!

00:02:00.829 --> 00:02:04.082
What are we going to do?
We lost our sword.

00:02:04.374 --> 00:02:05.500
I know that.

